 "infoHours": "Blue band: the range from the lowest to the highest forecast at that time. A wider band means more disagreement.\n\nDark line and numbers: the middle value of all forecasts.\n\nBlue bars: how many sources expect rain (chance 50% or more, or 0.5 mm or more).\n\nOrange background: forecasts clearly split. The middle half differ by more than 2.5 °C, or rain votes are close to half and half. A single outlier is not marked.",
